---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Btn from "../components/Btn.astro";
---

<Layout title="Download Sténtor" description="Download Sténtor. Free to try, no account required." noindex>
  <section class="max-w-[1080px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.12fr_0.88fr] gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start mb-10">
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-hairline bg-surface p-6 md:p-9 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-44px_rgba(0,0,0,0.75)]">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-red-500 mb-4">Download</p>
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-[72px] tracking-[-0.06em] leading-[0.98] font-semibold mb-5">Download Sténtor.</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-text-2 leading-[1.55] max-w-[720px] mb-8">
          Free to try. No account required. Start with the current desktop build, then use Sténtor to prepare, cue and share surtitles, translations and audio descriptions for live performance.
        </p>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-6">
          <a href="/contact" class="rounded-2xl border border-red-500/35 bg-red-500 text-bg p-4 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
            <span class="block font-mono text-[11px] opacity-75 mb-2">macOS</span>
            <strong class="block text-lg tracking-[-0.02em]">Apple Silicon</strong>
            <span class="block text-sm opacity-80 mt-1">Ask for current build</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/contact" class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-sunken p-4 transition-colors hover:border-hairline-strong">
            <span class="block font-mono text-[11px] text-text-3 mb-2">Windows</span>
            <strong class="block text-lg tracking-[-0.02em]">Coming next</strong>
            <span class="block text-sm text-text-3 mt-1">Stay informed</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/contact" class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-sunken p-4 transition-colors hover:border-hairline-strong">
            <span class="block font-mono text-[11px] text-text-3 mb-2">Linux</span>
            <strong class="block text-lg tracking-[-0.02em]">Planned</strong>
            <span class="block text-sm text-text-3 mt-1">Stay informed</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-text-3 leading-[1.55]">
          The form below is optional. Download first; tell us about your use only if you want to stay in touch or share field notes later.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="rounded-3xl border border-red-500/25 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/[0.16] to-surface p-6 md:p-7 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-46px_rgba(239,68,68,0.5)]">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-red-500 mb-3">Support the project</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[1.05] font-semibold mb-4">Use it freely. Donate if you can.</h2>
        <p class="text-text-2 leading-[1.6] mb-5">
          Sténtor keeps the same core features available to everyone. Donations help maintain the software, prepare builds and support research on live-performance text.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mb-5">
          <a href="/contact" class="h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-500 text-bg inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold">€10</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-500 text-bg inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold">€19</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-500 text-bg inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold">€99</a>
        </div>

        <Btn href="/contact" variant="primary">Donate or support Sténtor</Btn>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-3 leading-[1.5] mt-4">
          We can connect this button to Stripe, PayPal, Ko-fi, Open Collective or another donation service when you choose one.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[0.82fr_1.18fr] gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start">
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-hairline bg-sunken p-6 md:p-7">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-text-3 mb-3">Optional</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[1.08] font-semibold mb-4">Stay in touch after you try it.</h2>
        <p class="text-text-2 leading-[1.6] mb-5">
          This is not required for download. Use it only if you want to receive updates, tell us where Sténtor is being tested, or share field notes after rehearsal or performance.
        </p>
        <ul class="grid gap-2 text-sm text-text-3">
          <li>✓ no account</li>
          <li>✓ no waiting list</li>
          <li>✓ no tracking questionnaire before download</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <form
        name="stentor-field-notes"
        method="POST"
        action="/contact/"
        data-netlify="true"
        netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
        class="rounded-3xl border border-hairline bg-surface p-6 md:p-7 grid gap-4"
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="stentor-field-notes" />
        <p class="hidden">
          <label>Do not fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label>
        </p>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-[13px] text-text-2">Name</span>
            <input class="h-11 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-surface-2 px-3 text-sm text-text outline-none focus:border-red-500/70" type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" />
          </label>

          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-[13px] text-text-2">Email</span>
            <input class="h-11 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-surface-2 px-3 text-sm text-text outline-none focus:border-red-500/70" type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <label class="grid gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-[13px] text-text-2">Use context</span>
          <select class="h-11 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-surface-2 px-3 text-sm text-text outline-none focus:border-red-500/70" name="context">
            <option value="">Select one, if useful</option>
            <option>Independent artist or researcher</option>
            <option>Company or collective</option>
            <option>Theatre, festival or venue</option>
            <option>Translator or surtitler</option>
            <option>Audio describer</option>
            <option>Technician or operator</option>
            <option>Teacher or workshop leader</option>
            <option>Other</option>
          </select>
        </label>

        <label class="grid gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-[13px] text-text-2">Message or field notes</span>
          <textarea class="min-h-[116px] rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-surface-2 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-text outline-none focus:border-red-500/70 resize-y" name="message" placeholder="Tell us where you plan to try Sténtor, or come back after a rehearsal/performance and share what happened."></textarea>
        </label>

        <label class="flex gap-2.5 items-start text-[12.5px] leading-[1.45] text-text-3">
          <input class="mt-1 accent-red-500" type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" />
          <span>I agree to be contacted about Sténtor updates, optional feedback and research-related communication. See the <a href="/privacy" class="text-text underline underline-offset-2">Privacy Policy</a>.</span>
        </label>

        <button type="submit" class="w-full h-11 bg-red-500 text-bg rounded-lg font-medium text-sm inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(239,68,68,0.25)] hover:shadow-[0_10px_28px_rgba(239,68,68,0.35)] active:translate-y-px transition-all">
          Send optional notes
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
